.TH PACKETLENS 1 "2026-02-15" "Daniel Nylander" "PacketLens Manual"
.SH NAME
packetlens - GTK4 network capture analyzer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B packetlens
[\fIFILE\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpacketlens\fR is a comprehensive GTK4/Adwaita network analysis suite for pcap/pcapng captures. Features include a multi-tab analysis interface, Wireshark-style three-pane packet browser, protocol statistics, conversation analysis, DNS and HTTP analysis, TLS certificate inspection, file extraction from transfers, timeline visualization, BPF filtering, drag-and-drop file loading, and multi-language support.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/packetlens/
Configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/packetlens/
Cached data.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/yeager/pcap-viewer/issues
